<title>BELGIUM: EU sugar committee to focus on tenders, duties.</title>
<headline>EU sugar committee to focus on tenders, duties.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's weekly sugar management committee meeting on Wednesday will be routine, an EU official said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;The committee will be dealing only with the usual tenders, periodic duties and examining molasses import duties,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
